Shopify Liquid skill content

This plugin includes Shopify Liquid theme skill material adapted for the Cline
plugin ecosystem. The source manifest identifies the material as authored by
Shopify and licensed under the MIT License.

Source repository: https://github.com/Shopify/liquid-skills

Adaptations for this plugin include Cline package metadata, bounded local
diagnostics via `liquid_theme_diagnostics`, Markdown style normalization for
this repository, and Cline workflow notes for local theme-check usage.
